WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.670
- But I have to ask this 'cause
I remembered hearing this

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:03.900
and I was like, I gotta
ask her an interview.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.240
Is it sure that Jennifer
Aniston would come over

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.760
to play at your house as
a little girl in the 70s?

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.520
- As a teenager, I mean
as like a middle teenager

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.013
and eat me outta house and home and

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:14.846
(audience laughing)

00:00:14.846 --> 00:00:15.679
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:15.679 --> 00:00:18.060
it's like the kids, the
girls always used to,

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:20.190
you know they knew when
I would went to Balducci

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:23.940
and they would just show
up and just chow down

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.807
and she was a big chow downer.

00:00:26.807 --> 00:00:27.640
(audience laughing)

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:28.920
- I love it.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:29.753
I didn't know.

00:00:29.753 --> 00:00:30.586
I just think that's so funny,

00:00:30.586 --> 00:00:32.760
nobody knows that behind the
scenes of like how people

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:35.490
that you don't know are
related in some way,

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:37.050
in some capacity, like back in the day.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:38.340
That's so cool to me.

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:41.280
Did you know, did anybody
know that she was acting

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:42.660
and gonna do anything
like that at that age?

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:43.629
'Cause she was so young?

00:00:43.629 --> 00:00:45.900
- Well, no, I mean, she was
going to school, you know

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.210
she was going to High
School of Performing Arts.

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:51.000
And this is one thing that I know,

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.000
it's like when my mom used
to say to anybody she met,

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:58.260
I have a daughter who sings.

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:00.840
Well the minute you say that,
people just turn it off.

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:02.670
And she, and Ahmet Ertegun

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:07.564
the big manager and owner
of Atlantic Records,

00:01:07.564 --> 00:01:09.750
my mom said, I have a daughter who sings.

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.160
And he said, yes, Georgia, that's good.

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:15.420
And then he signed us
and then we're singing.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:17.430
And one night my mom comes in and he said,

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:18.630
Georgia, what are you doing here?

00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:21.420
And she said, I told you I
have a daughter that sings.

00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:22.749
There she is.

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:23.780
(audience laughing)

